      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "The moldering steed designates the living creature with the highest Will modifier within 120 feet as its prey. The steed gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception|PC1 checks to Seek|PC1 the prey and to Survival|PC1 checks to Track|PC1 the prey. The first time the steed hits its designated prey in a round, it deals an additional 1d8 precision damage. These effects last until the steed uses Hunt Will again."
      ],
