      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "When the moldering steed damages a living creature with its jaws Strike|PC1, the steed gains 20 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 minute, and the creature must succeed at a DC 38 Will save or become stupefied|PC1|stupefied 1. Further damage dealt by the steed increases the creature's stupefied|PC1 value on a failed save by 1, to a maximum of stupefied|PC1|stupefied 4."
      ],
